---

# SYSTEM ROLE

The Experimental subsystem functions as the controlled innovation environment of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It allows the system to safely explore, fail, iterate, and refine new concepts before they are considered for formal adoption.

It is the proving ground for future capabilities.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **Innovation requires freedom.
> Stability requires isolation.
> Experimental systems balance both by allowing exploration without production risk.**

